codex
I’ve switched the slice to the overlap-carry path in `PhaseVocoder`: when a streaming tail spans a ratio change, normalization now remembers the more expansion-prone ratio instead of instantly tightening to the newest ratio. I’m applying that in `src/stretch/phase_vocoder.rs` with one focused unit test in the same file.
